{"id": "ho01", "q": "My landlord says he needs the house for his son and wants me out. Does he have to give notice?", "lang": "en", "area": "tenancy", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "401", "contains": ["कम्तीमा पैँतीस दिनको अग्रिम लिखित सूचना"]}], "why": "s.401(1)(ga),(2): if the owner himself needs the house he must give at least 35 days' advance written notice; (3) he may not re-let it to others for 3 months."}
{"id": "ho02", "q": "ghar bhada ma basna lekhit sammauta garnai parchha? masik 15 hajar ko kotha ho", "lang": "roman", "area": "tenancy", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "386", "contains": ["मासिक बीस हजार रूपैयाँसम्मको घर बहालमा"]}], "why": "s.386(2): a written agreement is not required for rent up to Rs20,000 a month (otherwise s.386(1) requires one with the listed terms)."}
{"id": "ho03", "q": "A tenant vanished owing me 4 months of rent and left his things behind. How do I legally get my house back?", "lang": "en", "area": "tenancy", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "404", "contains": ["तीन महिना वा सोभन्दा बढी अवधिसम्म बहाल रकम"]}], "why": "s.404: where a tenant disappears for 3+ months without paying, the owner applies to the ward office, which gives a 15-day public notice and may then vacate the house and keep the goods in safe custody."}
{"id": "ho04", "q": "बहालमा बसेको घरको मर्मत कसले गर्ने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "tenancy", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "394", "contains": ["आवश्यक मर्मत सम्भार गर्ने दायित्व बहालमा लिने व्यक्तिको"]}], "why": "s.394(1): unless the agreement says otherwise, the tenant must do necessary maintenance; (2)-(4) if the agreement puts it on the owner and he ignores written notice, the tenant may repair and deduct the bill from rent."}
{"id": "ho05", "q": "I'm resigning after two years. How many days' notice must I give the company?", "lang": "en", "area": "labour", "expect": ["श्रम ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "144", "contains": ["एक वर्षभन्दा बढी अवधिको रोजगारीको हकमा कम्तीमा तीस दिन"]}], "why": "s.144(1)(ga): for employment over one year, at least 30 days' notice by either side; (3) the employer may deduct pay for the missed notice period."}
{"id": "ho06", "q": "राजीनामा दिएपछि कम्पनीले स्वीकृत नै गरेन भने के हुन्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "labour", "expect": ["श्रम ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "141", "contains": ["स्वतः स्वीकृत भएको मानिनेछ"]}], "why": "s.141(2)-(3): the employer must approve a written resignation within 15 days; if not, it is deemed approved from the day after the period ends."}
{"id": "ho07", "q": "company le contract nai nagari kaam ma lagayeko chha, ke yo milchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "labour", "expect": ["श्रम ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "11", "contains": ["रोजगार सम्झौता नगरी कसैलाई काममा लगाउन हुँदैन"]}], "why": "s.11(1): an employer may not put anyone to work without an employment contract (only casual work is exempt from a written one)."}
{"id": "ho08", "q": "Does my employer have to enrol me in the social security fund and how soon?", "lang": "en", "area": "social security", "expect": ["सामाजिक सुरक्षा ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "योगदानमा आधारित सामाजिक सुरक्षा ऐन, २०७४", "section": "20", "contains": ["तीन महिनाभित्र कोषमा सूचीकरण"]}], "why": "SSF Act s.20(1): a registered employer must enrol a worker with the Fund within 3 months of the employment relationship starting; (2) the worker may apply if the employer does not."}
{"id": "ho09", "q": "The agency put me in a different company at lower pay than my contract promised. What can I do?", "lang": "en", "area": "foreign employment", "expect": ["वैदेशिक रोजगार"], "sections": [{"doc": "वैदेशिक रोजगार ऐन, २०६४", "section": "55", "contains": ["सोभन्दा कम पारिश्रमिक र सुविधा"]}], "why": "s.55: a licensee who places a worker in another company/job or at lower pay and benefits than contracted is fined Rs1 lakh and the Department makes it pay the shortfall to the worker."}
{"id": "ho10", "q": "एजेन्सीले भिसा लगाएर कति समयभित्र पठाउनुपर्छ, नपठाए पैसा फिर्ता कति आउँछ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "foreign employment", "expect": ["वैदेशिक रोजगार"], "sections": [{"doc": "वैदेशिक रोजगार ऐन, २०६४", "section": "20", "contains": ["वार्षिक पच्चीस प्रतिशत"]}], "why": "s.20(1)-(2): the licensee must send the worker within 3 months of permission (or the stated entry period), failing which it must refund the money plus 25% a year within 30 days."}
{"id": "ho11", "q": "How long do I have to file a bounced cheque case?", "lang": "en", "area": "cheque bounce", "expect": ["बैङ्किङ्ग कसूर"], "sections": [{"doc": "बैङ्किङ्ग कसूर तथा सजाय ऐन, २०६४", "section": "17", "contains": ["चेक अनादर गरेको प्रमाणित भएको मितिले एक वर्षभित्र जाहेरी"]}], "why": "s.17(1ka): complain within one year of the dishonour being certified, and the case must be filed in the District Court within 6 months of the complaint."}
{"id": "ho12", "q": "Can a moneylender collect interest greater than the amount he lent me?", "lang": "en", "area": "loans/interest", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "481", "contains": ["साँवाभन्दा बढी ब्याज लिन पाउने छैन"]}], "why": "s.481: a creditor may not take interest exceeding the principal."}
{"id": "ho13", "q": "बैंकले एउटै किसिमको कर्जामा दुई ग्राहकलाई फरक ब्याजदर लगाउन मिल्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "loans/interest", "expect": ["एकीकृत निर्देशन"], "sections": [{"doc": "परिपत्र नं. १० (क, ख, ग) २०८२/८३: एकीकृत निर्देशन, २०८२", "title_contains": "कर्जाको ब्याजदर", "contains": ["एउटै प्रकृतिका कर्जा तथा सापटको ब्याजदर अन्तर"]}], "why": "NRB Unified Directive 2082, IPD 15/082 clause 3(dha7): the rate gap between loans of the same nature may not exceed 2 percentage points."}
{"id": "ho14", "q": "My husband has lived away from me for over three years without my consent. Can I divorce him?", "lang": "en", "area": "divorce", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "95", "contains": ["लगातार तीन वर्ष"]}], "why": "s.95(ka): a wife may divorce without the husband's consent if he has lived apart 3+ years without her consent (unless separated by partition/agreement); other grounds in (kha)-(cha)."}
{"id": "ho15", "q": "duijana ko sahamati chha bhane divorce kahile sukai garna milchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "divorce", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "93", "contains": ["जहिलेसुकै पनि"]}], "why": "s.93: if both spouses want it, they may divorce at any time."}
{"id": "ho16", "q": "आमा र बाबु छुट्टिएपछि बच्चा भेट्न पाइन्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "custody", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "117", "contains": ["समय समयमा भेट गर्न"]}], "why": "s.117(1): after the marriage ends or parents live apart, the child in one parent's custody must be allowed to meet the other parent from time to time, unless the district court bars it for the child's interest."}
{"id": "ho17", "q": "If a widow remarries, does she lose the property she took as her share?", "lang": "en", "area": "inheritance", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "214", "contains": ["अर्को विवाह गरेमा"]}], "why": "s.214(2): on remarriage the property she took as her share goes to the children of her previous husband, or to her if there are none."}
{"id": "ho18", "q": "अंशबण्डा गर्दा भाउजू गर्भवती छिन् भने गर्भमा रहेको बच्चाको भाग कसरी छुट्याउने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "partition", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "206", "contains": ["गर्भवती भएमा"]}], "why": "s.206(2)-(3): if a female अंशियार is pregnant and the child will be an अंशियार, a share is set aside for it; if no live child is born, other अंशियार divide it equally."}
{"id": "ho19", "q": "How long does a landowner have to apply to remove a tenant farmer?", "lang": "en", "area": "land", "expect": ["भूमि सम्बन्धी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "भूमि सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०२१", "section": "29क", "contains": ["निवेदन दिईसक्नुपर्छ"]}], "why": "Land Act s.29Ka: an eviction application must be made within 35 days of the act relied on (or 1 year plus 35 days in the (kha) case; 30 days in the (ga) case); after that no application lies."}
{"id": "ho20", "q": "मोहीले आफ्नो मोहियानी हक अरूलाई बेच्न पाउँछ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "land", "expect": ["भूमि सम्बन्धी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "भूमि सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०२१", "section": "26क", "contains": ["मोहीयानी हक खरीद गर्नवा"]}], "why": "Land Act s.26Ka: tenancy (mohiyani) rights cannot be bought, gifted or released to another; only a pre-existing pucca house plot has a limited exception."}
{"id": "ho21", "q": "What happens to bail money if the accused misses a court date?", "lang": "en", "area": "criminal procedure", "expect": ["मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "75", "contains": ["धरौटी जफत हुनेछ"]}], "why": "s.75(1): a person who has deposited धरौट and fails to appear on the fixed date forfeits it; (2) immovable security is sold to recover the amount."}
{"id": "ho22", "q": "1 barsa thunama basyo, mudda ko faisala aayena. jamanat ma chhutna sakinchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "criminal procedure", "expect": ["मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "77", "contains": ["एक वर्षभित्र मुद्दाको किनारा हुन नसकेमा"]}], "why": "s.77(1): if the case is not decided within a year of the first evidence hearing, the accused in custody may be released on धरौट or जमानत - except life/10-year-plus offences under s.67 and repeat offenders."}
{"id": "ho23", "q": "What is the punishment for stealing a mobile phone?", "lang": "en", "area": "criminal", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "242", "contains": ["तीन वर्षसम्म कैद र तीस हजार रुपैयााँसम्म जरिबाना"]}], "why": "s.242(2): ordinary theft (outside the aggravated cases in (1)) carries up to 3 years jail and Rs30,000 fine; aggravated theft in s.242(1) carries 2-7 years."}
{"id": "ho24", "q": "Within how many days must a complaint under the Electronic Transactions Act be filed?", "lang": "en", "area": "cyber", "expect": ["विद्युतीय (इलेक्ट्रोनिक) कारोबार"], "sections": [{"doc": "विद्युतीय (इलेक्ट्रोनिक) कारोबार ऐन, २०६३", "section": "74", "contains": ["नब्बे दिनभित्र"]}], "why": "s.74: a violation or offence under the Act must be reported within 90 days of learning of it."}
{"id": "ho25", "q": "As a crime victim, am I entitled to information about the case and compensation?", "lang": "en", "area": "constitutional", "expect": ["नेपालको संविधान"], "sections": [{"doc": "नेपालको संविधान", "section": "21", "contains": ["क्षतिपूर्ति"]}], "why": "Constitution Art.21: a crime victim has the right to information about the investigation and proceedings, and to social rehabilitation and justice including compensation."}
{"id": "ho26", "q": "Is torture of a person in police custody prohibited? Can the victim get compensation?", "lang": "en", "area": "constitutional", "expect": ["नेपालको संविधान"], "sections": [{"doc": "नेपालको संविधान", "section": "22", "contains": ["क्षतिपूर्ति पाउने हक हुनेछ"]}], "why": "Constitution Art.22: no physical or mental torture or cruel, inhuman or degrading treatment of an arrested or detained person; it is punishable and the victim has a right to compensation."}
{"id": "ho27", "q": "Can I speak to a lawyer immediately after being arrested?", "lang": "en", "area": "constitutional", "expect": ["नेपालको संविधान"], "sections": [{"doc": "नेपालको संविधान", "section": "20", "contains": ["आफूले रोजेको कानून व्यवसायीसँग सल्लाह लिन पाउने"]}], "why": "Constitution Art.20(2): an arrested person may consult a lawyer of their choice from the time of arrest and the consultation is confidential."}
{"id": "ho28", "q": "Can the court make my abusive husband pay my hospital bills?", "lang": "en", "area": "domestic violence", "expect": ["घरेलु हिंसा"], "sections": [{"doc": "घरेलु हिंसा (कसूर र सजाय) ऐन, २०६६", "section": "9", "contains": ["व्यहोर्नुपर्नेछ"]}], "why": "DV Act s.9: the perpetrator bears immediate treatment costs, and the whole hospital cost where the victim is incapacitated; if he cannot, the local level advances it and recovers from him."}
{"id": "ho29", "q": "घरेलु हिंसा गर्नेलाई के सजाय हुन्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "domestic violence", "expect": ["घरेलु हिंसा"], "sections": [{"doc": "घरेलु हिंसा (कसूर र सजाय) ऐन, २०६६", "section": "13", "contains": ["छ महिनासम्म कैद वा दुवै सजाय"]}], "why": "DV Act s.13(1ka): Rs3,000-25,000 fine or up to 6 months jail or both for ordinary domestic violence; injuries by maiming or acid are punished under general law (s.13(1))."}
{"id": "ho30", "q": "How many days do I have to return goods I bought at a shop if I changed my mind?", "lang": "en", "area": "consumer", "expect": ["उपभोक्ता संरक्षण"], "sections": [{"doc": "उपभोक्ता संरक्षण ऐन, २०७५", "section": "14", "contains": ["सात दिनभित्र"]}], "why": "Consumer Protection Act s.14(1): a purchaser may return goods within 7 days (or exchange or take a refund); (2) no deduction; (4) excluded categories such as perishables."}
{"id": "ho31", "q": "उपभोक्तालाई क्षति पुगेमा क्षतिपूर्तिको लागि कति समयभित्र उजुरी गर्ने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "consumer", "expect": ["उपभोक्ता संरक्षण"], "sections": [{"doc": "उपभोक्ता संरक्षण ऐन, २०७५", "section": "50", "contains": ["छ महिनाभित्र उजुरी गर्न"]}], "why": "Consumer Protection Act s.50: a claim for compensation must be filed in court within six months of the loss."}
{"id": "ho32", "q": "Can I get information within a day if my life is in danger?", "lang": "en", "area": "RTI", "expect": ["सूचनाको हक"], "sections": [{"doc": "सूचनाको हक सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६४", "section": "7", "contains": ["चौबीस घण्टाभित्र"]}], "why": "RTI Act s.7(4): information relating to a person's life or safety must be given within 24 hours of the request."}
{"id": "ho33", "q": "सूचना माग्दा कति शुल्क तिर्नुपर्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "RTI", "expect": ["सूचनाको हक"], "sections": [{"doc": "सूचनाको हक सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६४", "section": "8", "contains": ["वास्तविक लागतको आधारमा"]}], "why": "RTI Act s.8: the fee is fixed on the actual cost of providing the information; a fee above cost can be complained to the Commission (s.8(3))."}
{"id": "ho34", "q": "कम्पनीले अल्पसंख्यक शेयरधनीको हक हित विरुद्ध काम गरे अदालतमा जान मिल्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "company", "expect": ["कम्पनी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "कम्पनी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "139 (1)", "contains": ["अदालतमा उजूरी निवेदन दिन सक्नेछ"]}], "why": "Companies Act s.139(1): a shareholder may petition the court for a suitable order where the company's affairs are, or are about to be, conducted against shareholders' interests; (2) the petitioner must prove bad faith or unfair discrimination."}
{"id": "ho35", "q": "How do I register a small shop as a private firm?", "lang": "en", "area": "business registration", "expect": ["प्राइभेट फर्म"], "sections": [{"doc": "प्राइभेट फर्म रजिष्ट्रेशन ऐन, २०१४", "section": "3", "contains": ["रजिष्टर नगराई कसैले पनि प्राइभेट फर्म खोल्न हुँदैन"]}, {"doc": "प्राइभेट फर्म रजिष्ट्रेशन ऐन, २०१४", "section": "4", "contains": ["प्राइभेट फर्म रजिष्टर गराउन चाहने व्यक्तिले"]}], "why": "Private Firm Registration Act s.3: no private firm may be opened unregistered; s.4(1): apply to the concerned department with the prescribed fee and details (name, address, purpose, owner)."}
{"id": "ho36", "q": "NGO/sangh sanstha darta garna kati jana chahinchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "business registration", "expect": ["संस्था दर्ता ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "संस्था दर्ता ऐन, २०३४", "section": "4", "contains": ["सात जना वा सो भन्दा बढी"]}], "why": "Associations Registration Act s.4(1): seven or more persons apply to the local authority with the constitution and prescribed fee; s.3: no unregistered association may be set up."}
{"id": "ho37", "q": "Can a trader who is not VAT-registered show VAT on his bill?", "lang": "en", "area": "tax/VAT", "expect": ["मूल्य अभिवृद्धि कर"], "sections": [{"doc": "मूल्य अभिवृद्धि कर ऐन, २०५२", "section": "15", "contains": ["कर उठाउन हुँदैन"]}], "why": "VAT Act s.15(1): an unregistered person may not issue an invoice showing tax or collect tax; (2) any tax so collected is assessed and recovered from him."}
{"id": "ho38", "q": "Are banks allowed to charge me for stopping payment on a cheque?", "lang": "en", "area": "banking/NRB", "expect": ["एकीकृत निर्देशन"], "sections": [{"doc": "परिपत्र नं. १० (क, ख, ग) २०८२/८३: एकीकृत निर्देशन, २०८२", "title_contains": "खाता सञ्चालन तथा बन्द गर्दा लाग्ने शुल्क", "contains": ["Stop Payment"]}], "why": "NRB Unified Directive 2082, IPD 20/082 clause 6(ka): no service charge for account opening, cheque issue, Stop Payment, balance certification, statements etc. (only repeated statements for the same period may carry a minimum fee)."}
{"id": "ho39", "q": "What counts as an artificial or false trade in shares?", "lang": "en", "area": "securities", "expect": ["धितोपत्र सम्बन्धी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "धितोपत्र सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "94", "contains": ["वास्तविक स्वामित्वमा फरक नपर्ने"]}], "why": "Securities Act s.94: a trade where beneficial ownership does not change, or matched to a known opposing offer price, is an artificial/false trade; s.101(2) penalises it."}
{"id": "ho40", "q": "Can I hold two Nepali citizenship certificates at the same time?", "lang": "en", "area": "citizenship", "expect": ["नागरिकता"], "sections": [{"doc": "नेपाल नागरिकता ऐन, २०६३", "section": "13", "contains": ["एकभन्दा बढी नागरिकताको प्रमाणपत्र लिन हुँदैन"]}], "why": "Citizenship Act s.13: no one may hold more than one certificate; on migration the earlier certificate is surrendered and a new one issued."}
{"id": "ho41", "q": "बाबु आमाको पहिचान नभएको बच्चाले नेपाली नागरिकता पाउँछ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "citizenship", "expect": ["नागरिकता"], "sections": [{"doc": "नेपाल नागरिकता ऐन, २०६३", "section": "3 (1)", "contains": ["पितृत्व र मातृत्वको ठेगान नभएको"]}], "why": "Citizenship Act s.3(3): a minor found in Nepal with unknown parentage is treated as a citizen by descent until a parent is found, and may take citizenship at 16."}
{"id": "ho42", "q": "I knocked someone down with my car by accident. What must I do straight away?", "lang": "en", "area": "traffic accident", "expect": ["सवारी तथा यातायात"], "sections": [{"doc": "सवारी तथा यातायात व्यवस्था ऐन, २०४९", "section": "133", "contains": ["उपचारको लागि तुरून्त आवश्यक व्यवस्था"]}], "why": "Motor Vehicles Act s.133(1)-(2): the driver must immediately arrange treatment of the injured and, if no police are present, report the accident to the nearest police office."}
{"id": "ho43", "q": "gadi ko third party insurance nagareko chha. accident bhayo bhane compensation kasle dinuparchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "traffic accident", "expect": ["सवारी तथा यातायात"], "sections": [{"doc": "सवारी तथा यातायात व्यवस्था ऐन, २०४९", "section": "152", "contains": ["सवारी धनी वा व्यवस्थापकले क्षतिपूर्तिबापत दिनु पर्छ"]}], "why": "Motor Vehicles Act s.152(3): if a vehicle without the required third-party/comprehensive insurance causes loss, the owner or manager must pay the victim or heirs the amount that insurance would have paid."}
{"id": "ho44", "q": "A hospital refused to treat my father in an emergency. Is that legal?", "lang": "en", "area": "medical", "expect": ["जनस्वास्थ्य सेवा ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "जनस्वास्थ्य सेवा ऐन, २०७५", "section": "4", "contains": ["आकस्मिक स्वास्थ्य सेवा प्रदान गर्नुपर्नेछ"]}], "why": "Public Health Service Act 2075 s.4: every health institution must provide the prescribed emergency services, and s.4(3) requires immediate first treatment and referral if it cannot provide the service."}
{"id": "ho45", "q": "मरिसकेका बुवालाई फेसबुकमा बेइज्जती गर्दा हामीले क्षतिपूर्ति पाउँछौं?", "lang": "ne", "area": "defamation", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "307", "contains": ["निजको नजिकको हकवालालाई"]}], "why": "Criminal Code s.307(3): where a dead person is insulted, the offender must pay compensation and costs to the nearest heir."}
{"id": "ho46", "q": "My savings cooperative collapsed. Will I get my deposit back?", "lang": "en", "area": "cooperative", "expect": ["सहकारी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "सहकारी ऐन, २०७४", "section": "108क", "contains": ["पाँच लाख रुपैयाँ सम्मको बचत"]}], "why": "Cooperatives Act s.108Ka(1): even for a problem-declared cooperative, a member's savings up to Rs5 lakh are paid first; (2) above that, pro-rata under a set standard."}
{"id": "ho47", "q": "दाइजो माग्ने बिहे गर्न मिल्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "criminal", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "174", "contains": ["तीन वर्षसम्म कैद"]}], "why": "Criminal Code s.174(1)-(2): demanding dowry or property as a condition of marriage is prohibited - up to 3 years jail or Rs30,000 or both; (5) what was taken must be returned."}
{"id": "ho48", "q": "My employee took money I trusted him to deposit and spent it. Is that a crime?", "lang": "en", "area": "criminal", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "252", "contains": ["आफ्नो जिम्मा वा संरक्षणमा रहेको अर्काको सम्पत्ति बेइमानीपूर्वक"]}], "why": "Criminal Code s.252(2)(ka): dishonestly using or converting another's property held in one's charge is criminal breach of trust."}
{"id": "ho49", "q": "Can the land revenue office freeze a property that is in dispute?", "lang": "en", "area": "land/malpot", "expect": ["मालपोत ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "मालपोत ऐन, २०३४", "section": "8ख", "contains": ["रोक्का राख्न आवश्यक देखिएमा मालपोत कार्यालयले"]}], "why": "Malpot Act s.8Kha(1): where a house or land is in dispute or for another reason it needs to be frozen, the Malpot office may block it (rokka); (2) it must also block/release on a court's or office's written request."}
{"id": "ho50", "q": "What is the legal punishment if someone beats me up?", "lang": "en", "area": "criminal", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "191", "contains": ["तीन वर्षसम्म कैद वा तीस हजार रुपैयाँसम्म जरिबाना"]}], "why": "Criminal Code s.191(3): battery (causing physical pain) - up to 3 years jail or Rs30,000 fine or both; graver injury and negligence are in s.194-195."}
